  "details": "We have 18+ verification, let us actually use it. A number of worlds avatars and groups have been banned under the nudity rule, but they contain 0 nudity, but do involve adult themes or context. Let us age gate worlds so if a user is not verified 18+ they can't join the world. Also avatars and groups, let us age gate those as well so children can't use/see 18+ avatars or join 18+ groups. This would let creators continue to make worlds avatars and groups while keeping children out of them and in age appropriate worlds avatars and groups. Worlds avatars and groups that contain adult themes but are not labelled 18+ can be removed as per usual.\n\nIf you want furries, anime fans and adult players to leave the platform just tell us and we will leave and go to Resonite. Otherwise let us use the 18+ verification to keep children safe and our communities intact.",
